<div class="practice-page">
  <a href="/" class="back-link">← Back to exercises</a>
  <h1 class="practice-title">Key Presses</h1>
  <div class="practice-banner"><ul>
    <li>Click the input then use <code>sendKeys()</code> to send a key press</li>
    <li>Assert the <em>You entered: KEY</em> text updates correctly after each key</li>
    <li>Try special keys: <code>Keys.TAB</code>, <code>Keys.ENTER</code>, <code>Keys.ESCAPE</code>, <code>Keys.ARROW_UP</code></li>
  </ul></div>

